  "title": "Aveanna to Participate at the Barclays 30th Annual Leveraged Finance Conference",
  "summary": "ATLANTA, April 28, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Aveanna Healthcare Holdings Inc. (“Aveanna”) (NASDAQ: AVAH) today announced that its management team will attend the Barclays 30 th Annual Leveraged Finance Conference in Austin, TX on May 19, 2026. Management will host 1x1 investor meetings that day.",
